Package: tlgagent
Title: A commons Example Agent for Clinical-Trial TLG
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: A publicly available example of a commons self-service data
    agent for the pharma clinical-trials space. It answers safety and
    compliance questions about a study by running validated Tables,
    Listings, and Graphs recipes from the insightsengineering/tlg-catalog
    over CDISC ADaM sample data from random.cdisc.data.
